{"id":"vod_sn_35656","vodId":"35656","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"植木的法则","name_cn":"植木的法则","date":"2005-01-01","year":"2005","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/6811cb4134f5f5055e1870a59cc46ceb.jpg"},"summary":"火野国中1年级的植木耕助，某天突然得到了“将自己认为是垃圾的东西变成树”的能力，授予他这个能力的是天神候补的天界人小林老师。100名天神候补授予各自选中的中学生以不同的能力，让其战斗，能够选中最强中学生的天神候补就可以成为下届的神。于是一场惊天动地的战斗展开了。　　但是这种能力一旦伤害普通的人类，自身拥有的才能就会一点点消失。然而一旦在战斗中胜出的话，就能拥有”空白之才“（拥有者能拥有任何一种想要的才能），即使是再恐怖的能力也有可能。　　植木为了不让“空白之才”落入邪恶之人的手中，决定贯彻自己的正义，守护“空白之才”。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:36:33","playable":true,"episodeCount":51,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/aHqjEHywVA1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/Dk3Rt4sevR1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/gmG211YbV31/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/dbYDS6xV3e1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/F2peD7DYC61/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/uc7GHv9QPj1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/wqtcQGW6Gw1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/dWxBehzt6A1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/PmVCbN3ey81/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/U7FkyTts2X1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/MRBu7VEuE91/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/3ivGhuc87G1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/40JAXm7xmk1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/PwzmjLitai1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://v6.rstu6